Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: libc6
Suggests: smartmontools, nvme-cli, xfsprogs, iw
Maintainer: TaskForest contributors <noreply@yellowwhiteblackcat.github.io>
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Homepage: https://github.com/YellowWhiteBlackCat/TaskForest
Description: Fast, terminal-native system monitor
 TaskForest-T is the fast, terminal-native Ratatui frontend for the TaskForest
 system monitor. It renders live CPU, memory, GPU, network, storage,
 and per-process telemetry directly in any standard terminal without
 requiring a Wayland session or GPU driver libraries (X11 is not supported).
 .
 Designed for headless servers, containers, remote SSH sessions, and minimal
 environments. Supports interactive monitoring, headless text snapshots,
 and structured JSON exports. Zero graphical or X11 dependencies.
